Package: zfly
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZFly contributors <zfly@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, libglib2.0-bin, gsettings-desktop-schemas, adwaita-icon-theme, librsvg2-common, fonts-noto-cjk, ca-certificates
Recommends: gtk-update-icon-cache
Description: standalone GTK proxy and subscription manager
 ZFly manages profiles, subscriptions, proxy cores, persistent settings, and
 system proxy settings. It includes a private mihomo core and a native GTK 4
 and libadwaita interface.
